				<article class="elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-237 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-news" role="listitem">
			<div class="elementor-post__card">
				<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="https://navttc.gov.pk/executive-director-visits-navttc-partner-institute/" tabindex="-1" ><div class="elementor-post__thumbnail"><img width="1024" height="718" src="https://navttc.gov.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Executive-Director-visits-NAVTTC-partner-institute.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-238" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="https://navttc.gov.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Executive-Director-visits-NAVTTC-partner-institute.jpg 1024w, https://navttc.gov.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Executive-Director-visits-NAVTTC-partner-institute-300x210.jpg 300w, https://navttc.gov.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Executive-Director-visits-NAVTTC-partner-institute-768x539.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></div></a>
				<div class="elementor-post__badge">News</div>
				<div class="elementor-post__text">
				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="https://navttc.gov.pk/executive-director-visits-navttc-partner-institute/" >
				Executive Director visits NAVTTC partner institute			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>Executive Director (ED) NAVTTC Mr. Muhammad Amir Jan, along with his team, visited COTHM institute Lahore. COTHM is a partner institute of NAVTTC for imparting skills training of hospitality, chef and tourism courses under Prime Minister’s Youth Skill Development Program. </p>
		</div>
		
		<a class="elementor-post__read-more" href="https://navttc.gov.pk/executive-director-visits-navttc-partner-institute/" aria-label="Read more about Executive Director visits NAVTTC partner institute" tabindex="-1" >
			Read More »		</a>

				</div>
				<div class="elementor-post__meta-data">
					<span class="elementor-post-date">
			May 22, 2024		</span>
				<span class="elementor-post-avatar">
			No Comments		</span>
				</div>
					</div>
		</article>
				<article class="elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-234 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-news" role="listitem">
			<div class="elementor-post__card">
				<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="https://navttc.gov.pk/kpk-tvet-convened-by-navttc-in-peshawar/" tabindex="-1" ><div class="elementor-post__thumbnail"><img width="1024" height="682" src="https://navttc.gov.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/NAVTTC-and-NUTECH-signed-MoU.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-226" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="https://navttc.gov.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/NAVTTC-and-NUTECH-signed-MoU.jpg 1024w, https://navttc.gov.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/NAVTTC-and-NUTECH-signed-MoU-300x200.jpg 300w, https://navttc.gov.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/NAVTTC-and-NUTECH-signed-MoU-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></div></a>
				<div class="elementor-post__badge">News</div>
				<div class="elementor-post__text">
				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="https://navttc.gov.pk/kpk-tvet-convened-by-navttc-in-peshawar/" >
				KPK TVET convened by NAVTTC in Peshawar			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>A collaborative meeting of KPK TVET stakeholders was convened by NAVTTC in Peshawar with support provided by GIZ to facilitate stakeholder deliberations on Pakistan&#8217;s TVET landscape. Mr. Aamir Jan, Executive Director NAVTTC and Mr. Matiullah Khan, Secretary Industries, Commerce &#038; Technical Education department co-chaired the dialogue. </p>
		</div>
		
		<a class="elementor-post__read-more" href="https://navttc.gov.pk/kpk-tvet-convened-by-navttc-in-peshawar/" aria-label="Read more about KPK TVET convened by NAVTTC in Peshawar" tabindex="-1" >
			Read More »		</a>

				</div>
				<div class="elementor-post__meta-data">
					<span class="elementor-post-date">
			May 22, 2024		</span>
				<span class="elementor-post-avatar">
			No Comments		</span>
				</div>
					</div>
		</article>
				<article class="elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-231 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-news" role="listitem">
			<div class="elementor-post__card">
				<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="https://navttc.gov.pk/navttc-and-karachi-chamber-of-commerce-industry-ink-mou-to-promote-skill-training-initiatives/" tabindex="-1" ><div class="elementor-post__thumbnail"><img width="1600" height="1059" src="https://navttc.gov.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/NAVTTC-and-Karachi-Chamber-of-Commerce-Industry-ink-MoU-to-promote-skill-training-initiatives.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-232" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="https://navttc.gov.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/NAVTTC-and-Karachi-Chamber-of-Commerce-Industry-ink-MoU-to-promote-skill-training-initiatives.jpg 1600w, https://navttc.gov.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/NAVTTC-and-Karachi-Chamber-of-Commerce-Industry-ink-MoU-to-promote-skill-training-initiatives-300x199.jpg 300w, https://navttc.gov.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/NAVTTC-and-Karachi-Chamber-of-Commerce-Industry-ink-MoU-to-promote-skill-training-initiatives-1024x678.jpg 1024w, https://navttc.gov.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/NAVTTC-and-Karachi-Chamber-of-Commerce-Industry-ink-MoU-to-promote-skill-training-initiatives-768x508.jpg 768w, https://navttc.gov.pk/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/NAVTTC-and-Karachi-Chamber-of-Commerce-Industry-ink-MoU-to-promote-skill-training-initiatives-1536x1017.jpg 1536w" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px" /></div></a>
				<div class="elementor-post__badge">News</div>
				<div class="elementor-post__text">
				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="https://navttc.gov.pk/navttc-and-karachi-chamber-of-commerce-industry-ink-mou-to-promote-skill-training-initiatives/" >
				NAVTTC and Karachi Chamber of Commerce &amp; Industry ink MoU to promote skill training initiatives			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>NAVTTC and Karachi Chamber of Commerce &#038; Industry ink MoU to promote skill training initiatives, provide on the job training for NAVTTC trainees and establish strong industrial linkages between NAVTTC and industry.</p>
		</div>
		
		<a class="elementor-post__read-more" href="https://navttc.gov.pk/navttc-and-karachi-chamber-of-commerce-industry-ink-mou-to-promote-skill-training-initiatives/" aria-label="Read more about NAVTTC and Karachi Chamber of Commerce &amp; Industry ink MoU to promote skill training initiatives" tabindex="-1" >
