				Chairman Prime Minister’s Youth Programme, VISITED NATIONAL VOCATIONAL AND TECHNICAL TRAINING COMMISSION (NAVTTC)			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>Chairman Prime Minister’s Youth Programme, visited NAVTTC to discuss various youth-focused initiatives.The meeting was about empowering youth with skills training, and entrepreneurship opportunities through dynamic public-private partnerships.</p>
		</div>
		
